{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><strong>Rock\u2013Paper\u2013Scissors... but this time, it\u2019s in the game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle and compete with your friends online in a fast-paced, chaotic party experience! Discover various game modes, multiple maps, character costumes, and powerful special abilities waiting for you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691550/extras/a831ef0d487844e96921c529065b9610.poster.avif?t=1768926891\" width=600 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691550/extras/a831ef0d487844e96921c529065b9610.webm?t=1768926891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691550/extras/a831ef0d487844e96921c529065b9610.mp4?t=1768926891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Classic Rock\u2013Paper\u2013Scissors Balance</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chase one while escaping the other!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer Party</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clash with your friends or players from all over the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691550/extras/d8889f0078a162ffc9aa629144b9b454.poster.avif?t=1768926891\" width=600 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691550/extras/d8889f0078a162ffc9aa629144b9b454.webm?t=1768926891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691550/extras/d8889f0078a162ffc9aa629144b9b454.mp4?t=1768926891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Character Abilities</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dance, dash, slide, and spit! These are your core skills. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect various abilities from the map and use them tactically. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect experience points and gain an advantage with your character's special ability.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691550/extras/655cba7bebea1c5e5cff010794f6a056.poster.avif?t=1768926891\" width=600 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691550/extras/655cba7bebea1c5e5cff010794f6a056.webm?t=1768926891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691550/extras/655cba7bebea1c5e5cff010794f6a056.mp4?t=1768926891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Various Game Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight as a team or duel one-on-one. Compete and have fun with mission and contest-based modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple Arenas</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience exciting mechanics across different maps!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each arena has unique environmental elements, use them smartly to outplay your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >